:: start default
> intro@10000000000000000001
  The signal clears.
> prompt@10000000000000000002
  Where next?
  ? inspect_relay@10000000000000000003
    Inspect the relay.
    -> relay
  ? leave@10000000000000000004
    Leave.
    -> END

:: relay
! immediate focus_camera(relay)
> relay_line@10000000000000000005
  The relay is warm.
! blocking grant_item(relay_key)
> after_key@10000000000000000006
  The relay key clicks free.
! deferred mark_seen(relay)
-> END
